# Trade (docs/plans/trade.md). A custom game on the Blank map trades with its realm's partners, their
# routes closed (Campaign I's Đê Sơn and the highland clans by land, Vijara by sea); trade.set opens a
# route and sets limits; the City book's Finances page shows the trade lines in a game that trades; the
# world map's panel shows a partner's terms and opens Đê Sơn's route through its popup; the trade
# limits dialog sets a limit; caravans trade at a storage yard and a granary; then a river laid to the
# map's edge, a dock from the Trade grid, Vijara's sea route opened from the world map (needing the
# dock first), and a ship that moors while its dockers unload its metal and load the city's rice (the
# dock's and the ship's panels); the state survives a save and a load.
# From the repository root:
#   cargo run -p HeritageBuilder -- --fresh-profile --script crates/game/tests/scenarios/trade.jsonl
{"method": "time.fixed_dt", "params": {"dt": 0.016667}}
{"method": "assert.eq", "params": {"query": "session.state", "path": "/menus_mode", "value": "Home"}}
{"method": "ui.click", "params": {"path": "Home/Custom Game"}}
{"method": "assert.eq", "params": {"query": "dialog.current", "path": "/current", "value": "CustomGame"}}
{"method": "ui.click", "params": {"path": "CustomGame/Start"}}
{"method": "wait.until", "params": {"query": "session.state", "path": "/menus_mode", "op": "eq", "value": "InGame", "timeout_frames": 60}}
{"method": "assert.eq", "params": {"query": "session.state", "path": "/custom_game/map", "value": "blank"}}
{"method": "sim.pause"}

